# Service-account keys. Matched by pattern, not by filename: the entry here used to
# name a single key, so a second one issued later (Google puts a fresh hash in every
# filename) was not ignored and could have been committed. Credentials reach the app
# through FIREBASE_* env vars — no key file belongs in this repo.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*-serviceaccount*.json
service-account*.json

# Nested project folders — never part of this app build
Career-Mode-Portal-final2-broken-*
INVA_Flight_Tracker
